{
  "_comment": [
    "Developer panel consumed by real-estate-engine (data/inbox/emaar_dld_quarterly_by_entity.csv).",
    "Built by tools/export-developer-panel.ts. Developer list, order and attribution labels follow the hand-made panel of",
    "11 Sep 2026, plus 1275 Mina Rashid Properties, which it was missing. The authoritative scope lives in",
    "real-estate-engine/config/emaar_entity_scope_documented.csv.",
    "Definition changed on 16 Sep 2026 from the legacy one (tools/panels/emaar-legacy.json), which counted mortgages and",
    "gifts as sales and reported a mean as a median.",
    "An entry with project_numbers is a project-level entity: only those projects count, and its entity_id is '<developer>/<project>'. 1212/2957 and 1162/3487 were confirmed as Emaar Development sales on 16 Sep 2026."
  ],
  "output_name": "emaar_dld_quarterly_by_entity",
  "from_quarter": "2022Q1",
  "definition": {
    "_comment": "Sales registrations only, split by reg_type. median_price_per_sqm is a true median over the prices dpi's own reports accept (report-lib PSM_OK, 500-200,000 AED/sqm inclusive). mapped_transaction_percentage is dropped: it was 100 by construction and measured nothing; attribution is measured by the orphan share in the manifest.",
    "trans_groups": [
      "Sales"
    ],
    "price_per_sqm": {
      "statistic": "median",
      "min_inclusive": 500,
      "max_inclusive": 200000
    },
    "exclude_withdrawn": false
  },
  "maturity": {
    "_comment": "A quarter is provisional if it is within the trailing N quarters of source_as_of (the current, partial quarter counts as the first), or if more than max_orphan_share of that quarter's registrations market-wide carry a project number we do not hold, so cannot be attributed to any developer. On 16 Sep 2026 mature quarters ran 0.06-0.13% orphans, 2025Q4 0.80%, 2026 2.2-2.8%. The orphan rule applies only within orphan_rule_lookback_quarters, where a gap can still close; an older quarter over the threshold is reported as an attribution gap instead (2023Q4: 1.8%, two projects no source lists any more).",
    "provisional_trailing_quarters": 2,
    "max_orphan_share": 0.005,
    "orphan_rule_lookback_quarters": 6
  },
